<p>Baked Brand's Thai FDA-approved Chocolate Chip Cookie contains up to 1.6mg THC per piece. That's the approved benchmark for microdose edibles in Thailand. Cannabis brownies sold without FDA approval may contain far higher doses with no quality control, which creates genuine risk for anyone unfamiliar with how edibles work.</p>
