<p>Each piece contains up to 1.6mg THC, manufactured in our own licensed factory in Chiang Mai from full-spectrum cannabis leaf infused into real butter. The THC content is tested, labelled accurately, and consistent batch to batch. For anyone who wants to know exactly what they're taking before they take it, that consistency matters.</p>
