<p>The most common mistake first-timers make is assuming the edible "isn't working" after 30 to 45 minutes and taking more. At 1.6mg, the effect should be subtle: mild relaxation, a gentle mood shift, possibly a soft reduction in tension. If you feel nothing after 90 minutes, one more piece is a reasonable next step.</p>
